isks like egress costs, presents a more robust foundation for negotiating enforceable terms and has a proven track record that, when coupled with strong contractual safeguards, aligns best with my objective of ensuring vendor accountability and mitigating unforeseen financial liabilities.", "confidence": 0.75}, "confidence_score": 0.75, "execution_time_seconds": 10.4, "error": null}	20	2026-05-13 08:35:03.054504
