8c8c6003-d548-453c-ae24-30d39c3ea587	completed	["OmegaCloud", "SkyBridge", "DataVault", "NexaCloud", "CloudPrime"]	2026-05-15 10:03:07.716552	2026-05-15 10:05:45.99119	3b893e07-39bc-4701-abc6-0eff98614e03	{"size": "500-5000", "region": "EU/Germany", "industry": "Technology", "techStack": "", "companyName": "MERIDIAN LOGISTICS GmbH", "keyRequirements": ". Cloud Infrastructure & Technical Requirements\\nInfrastructure: Multi-region deployment within the EU (Frankfurt and Dublin preferred).\\n\\nHigh Availability: 99.99% uptime SLA for core production workloads.\\n\\nScalability: Auto-scaling to handle 300% peak traffic during seasonal logistics spikes.\\n\\nMigration: Support for migration of 450+ VMs and 12TB of PostgreSQL/SAP HANA data.\\n\\nLatency: Sub-20ms latency required between cloud instances and the Frankfurt data center.\\n\\nIntegration: Full compatibility with SAP S/4HANA, Salesforce, and Microsoft 365.\\n\\nInnovation: Native support for Kubernetes (K8s) and serverless functions for new microservices.\\n\\n2. Security & Compliance Requirements\\nData Sovereignty: All data must be stored and processed exclusively within the European Union (EU).\\n\\nCertifications: ISO 27001, SOC 2 Type II, and TISAX (Level 3) compliance.\\n\\nEncryption: AES-256 for data at rest; TLS 1.3 for data in transit; customer-managed keys (CMK) support.\\n\\nGDPR: Full compliance with Article 28 and a signed Data Processing Agreement (DPA).\\n\\nNetwork: Dedicated private connectivity (Direct Connect/ExpressRoute) and WAF/DDoS protection.\\n\\nAccess: Integration with Azure Active Directory via SAML 2.0/OIDC.\\n\\n3. Operational & Service Level Requirements (SLAs)\\nSupport: 24/7/365 \\"follow-the-sun\\" technical support with a dedicated Technical Account Manager (TAM).\\n\\nResponse Times: * P1 (Critical): 15-minute response.\\n\\nP2 (High): 1-hour response.\\n\\nDisaster Recovery: RPO < 15 minutes; RTO < 2 hours for critical systems.\\n\\nAuditing: Right-to-audit clause for Meridian’s internal teams with 30 days' notice.\\n\\nIncident Notification: Notification of P1 breaches within 1 hour.\\n\\n4. Commercial & Financial Requirements\\nCurrency: All pricing must be provided in EUR (€).\\n\\nContract: 36-month initial term with price protection (max 4% annual increase).\\n\\nPayment Terms: Net 60 days.\\n\\nInvoicing: Quarterly invoicing with detailed cost breakdowns by business unit.\\n\\nIncentives: Multi-year discounts and migration credits are expected"}
